Package: quadrupen
Type: Package
Title: Sparse and Group Sparse Linear Models
Version: 1.0-0
Date: 2026-05-xx
Authors@R: person("Julien", "Chiquet", , "julien.chiquet@inrae.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3629-3429"))
Description: This package fits the solution paths of classical sparse regression 
  models with efficient active set algorithms by solving small sub-problems. 
  Include LASSO, SCAD, MCP, (Sparse) Group-LASSO, Cooperative-LASSO, LAVA and 
  Elastic-Net variants. Also provides a few methods for model selection purpose 
  (cross-validation, stability selection).
URL: https://github.com/jchiquet/quadrupen, https://jchiquet.github.io/quadrupen/
